This directory contains source code for the GNU Project's C "traditional"
preprocessor, hand-extracted from the GNU Compiler Collection (gcc-3.2.2)
tarball.  Functionality has been reduced; see localshared.h for stub defs.

If you do "make realclean" you will need yacc to do "make".
Otherwise, only cc is required.

Under VMS, try "mms" or "mms clean" or "mms zip".
